        text: "[Condensed paraphrase] In the first age of the Kumulipo, born was the coral polyp in the sea, born the worm that creeps, born the shellfish and the swarming things; born in the sea the fish, and on the land the man. Night began, night ended: the deep darkness of Po brought forth, and the light of day followed after."
