        text: "[Condensed paraphrase] Jurate the sea-maiden ruled the deep in a palace built of amber under the Baltic waves; when the fisherman Kastytis dared to fish in her waters and his nets were cut by her servants, she rose in anger to chide him \u2014 and finding him fair, took him to the amber palace and loved him."
