        id: "1",
        text: "Condensed paraphrase of Bundahishn 1 (West 1880): 'Ohrmazd is in the light on high, Ahriman in the abyss of darkness below... both are limited and unlimited... between them is the void, in which their meeting shall occur.' Ohrmazd creates the creation spiritually first, then materially, in six stages. Not verbatim.",
