        text: "Five hundred and forty doors there are in Valhalla, and through each go eight hundred warriors when they issue to fight the wolf; its roof is thatched with shields, its benches strewn with byrnies, and its rafters are spears. Every day the einherjar go out into the courtyard and fight and slay each other; when the meal-hour comes they ride home to the hall and sit down together, healed of their wounds. The boar Saehrimnir is boiled every day and is whole again by evening; the goat Heidrun hangs from the roof and fills the cups with mead.",
