        id: "1",
        text: "Nidadr hamstrung the smith and set him on the island Saevarstad to forge treasures; the smith's revenge was wrought in the king's own kin: the two boys killed, their skulls fashioned into drinking-cups for the queen, their eyes into gems for the king, their teeth into brooches for the princess.",
