      work: "Ragnars saga lo\xF0br\xF3kar; Kr\xE1kum\xE1l; ed. C. C. Rafn, Fornaldar sogur; Kr\xE1kum\xE1l English in Hollander, The Skalds, 1945",
      url: "https://handrit.is/"
