        text: "Bound between two fires, the masked one recited: five hundred and forty doors there are in Valhalla, and through each go eight hundred warriors; Thrudheim is Thor's, Breidablik is Baldr's where no unclean thing is, Himinbjorg stands at the bridge's edge.",
