        id: "1",
        text: "The three enthroned teachers answered in order: the void, Ymir and the cow, the world from the giant's body, the sun and moon set on their courses, the norns under the tree, the halls of the gods, and each god's office - so the catechism ran from the beginning to the Renewal. And when the teaching was done, Gangleri looked about and saw a great plain, no hall and no lords; he went his way and came to his kingdom, and told what he had seen and heard.",
