        id: "1",
        text: "Gu\xF0r\xFAn's four dreams were read as her four marriages: the water-laden hat (weeping), the silver ring from the lake (lost), the gold ring (a king's son), and the helm of the battle-woman - a warrior woman shall be thy fate. Asked in old age whom she loved best, Gu\xF0r\xFAn answered: 'I was worst to him whom I loved most' - love as the engine of the family's ruin.",
