      en: "Sigurd's father's own career collected: the apple-sign and the great hall, Signy's forced marriage and the vengeance-plot (the shape-shift into wolves, the wolf-coat years of Sinfjotli), the disguised rescue and the burning of Siggeir's hall, Sigmund's later wars and marriages (the shipwrecked bride, Hjordis and the broken Gram), and Odin's final withdrawal (the spear shattering the sword at the last battle - the god reclaiming his gift). The record is the father-arc: the vengeance-plot that makes Sigurd possible.",
