      note: "Passages are the compiler's condensed paraphrases of the Shanhaijing and Wu Yue Chunqiu originals. The nine-tailed fox later becomes the seductive fox-spirit of the Investiture of the Gods (Daji) \u2014 a radical inversion cut as a separate record."
