        id: "1",
        text: "The Master of the Intercepts called up every disciple of his sect \u2014 immortals, beast-spirits, bugbears of the islands \u2014 and marshalled them in the last formation, ten thousand strong, its gates hung with the banners of his teaching. The Patriarchs of the West came down in force \u2014 Laozi with his cart, Yuanshi with his seal, and the two Buddhas of the western gate with their own banners \u2014 and the formation was broken from within: the sea of immortal disciples flooded, and the field filled with the captured, the slain and the beasts ground back to their true shapes.",
