        id: "2",
        text: "'Heaven speaketh, and the earth trembleth, the Earth-god Keb quaketh, and the two regions of the god utter a noise,' and as a result the food whereon the gods and the blessed live is created. Osiris was the 'great word,' and he gave orders to the Spirits, and he was the 'word of what cometh into being and what is not.' In other words, Osiris the Word spake the words through which all things in heaven came into being from non-existence.",
