        summary: "In the Nihongi the princes sail and sojourn for years before the assault; Nagasune-biko first repulses a vanguard led by Nigi-hayabi, whose master Shinatsu-hiko turns back; Itsuse is wounded in the arm by Nagasune's arrow and speaks the same 'not right to fight facing the sun' lament before dying at the Kii river-mouth; the sword drops through Takakuraji's storehouse in a dream of Futsu-nushi-no-kami acting for Takemikazuchi; the crow Yatagarasu guides the host; and Nagasune is finally shot down in a negotiated encounter after Michi-no-omi's forces land in force.",
