      en: "Governor Cocom begins to covet riches and arranges with the Mexican garrisons kept at Tabasco and Xicalango to hand over his city. The Mexican troops enter Mayapan, the governor oppresses the poor and makes slaves \u2014 the first to do so, the record insists \u2014 and the Yucatecans, learning the use of the bow, the lance and the axe, cease to fear them.",
