        id: "1",
        text: "The Paris manuscript preserves the cycle of the thirteen katuns, the count in which each katun of twenty years is ruled by its own lord and carries its own prophecy. The wheel of the katuns is the Maya zodiac: figures of the katun lords with their dates and their omens, the frame into which the Books of Chilam Balam pour their histories.",
