        text: "The antiquity of this priest has not been made out, but he appears to have flourished before the coming of the Spaniards, since he speaks of the last age; and by age they understood the space of time of twenty years. With the introduction of our Holy Catholic Faith the cult of the idols ceased, at least publicly, and this new world was purified with the fire of the Holy Spirit.",
