        id: "1",
        text: "In case you make an offering of three hundred bags of rice to the Buddha of our temple, you will be restored to sight, you will be given rank and dignity, while your daughter will become the first woman in all Korea. Sim Chung, hearing that the sea merchants would buy a maiden to quiet the evil spirit of the Indangsu, decided that it must be the fulfilment of her dream: she put on old clothes and fasted while journeying, that she might look wan and haggard, like one in mourning.",
