        id: "1",
        text: "In the Admiralty Islands it is said that Manual was alone and longed for a wife. So he took his axe, went into the forest, and cut down a tree, and after he had fashioned the trunk into the figure of a woman, he spoke to it: 'My wood there, become a woman!' And the image came to life \u2014 the first marriage of mankind made not by finding a bride but by carving one, the carver's speech turning wood into flesh.",
