        text: "Olga then sent to the Drevlians: 'If you ask me in truth, send your best men to my city, that I may go to your prince with great honour.' The Drevlians chose their most distinguished men and sent them. On their arrival Olga offered water for the bath, saying: 'Wash yourselves and appear before me.'",
