        id: "1",
        text: "Iskorosten stood firm behind its walls, and Olga encamped before the city the whole summer. Then she sent this message: 'What do you want of me? I have taken vengeance on your princes and your city \u2014 I do not desire tribute to levy it again; I asked it once. Pay me the tribute, and I will depart.' The Drevlians asked what she wanted, and Olga answered, 'Give me three pigeons and three sparrows from each house.'",
