      work: "Walter E. Roth, An Inquiry into the Animism and Folk-lore of the Guiana Indians (33rd Annual Report, Bureau of American Ethnology, 1915), ch. V 'The Body and Its Associated Spirits', \xA764B (adapting Brett 1880)",
