        text: "Seeking to win the daughter of the sun, God's son makes for her an island in the midst of the sea \u2014 either the first dark shadows of evening or the first bits of light at dawn; or the two sons kindle two lights in the sea, awaiting her, and in the centre of the ocean they build a bridal chamber, which she enters tremblingly.",
