        id: "2",
        text: "She is urged to awake early, for God's sons are coming to roll apples \u2014 the apple-play of the Baltic wedding, where the fruit stands for the disk of the light. The wooing of dawn by the morning star is thus built in the sea itself: every daybreak raises the island, lights the fires, and rolls the apple again.",
