      note: "Living Haudenosaunee tradition recorded 1900s-1922; published in Parker 1923 (public domain). Included as sacred narrative of record; not a ritual manual. Cross-tradition tagging of 'clay-humans' and 'sibling-creators' is an interpretive act (Thompson index is Euro-American)."
