        id: "1",
        text: "\\gaunu, he was formerly a great Star; therefore, his name is \\gaunu, while he feels that he was the one who formerly spoke (called) the Stars' names; while he feels that he is a great one. Therefore, he called the Stars' names. Therefore, the Stars possess their names; while they feel that \\gaunu was the one who called their names.",
