        text: "The morning song opens on the sleeping house: the doors shut, the household asleep, the god rising beside the goddess while the city's fires are not yet lit. Dumuzi sings of the flocks still folded, the meadows unopened, the bed still warm \u2014 the shepherd's world paused around the lovers \u2014 and the song closes with the couple blessed in their union.",
