        id: "1",
        text: "At dawn Lugalbanda's fever breaks as if it had never been; he takes the rations his brothers left and prepares an offering table in the cave: bread before Inanna and the great river gods, unguent, libations of beer and water.",
        note: "Paraphrase of ETCSL c.1.8.2.1, the offerings; not verbatim."
