        id: "1",
        text: "The lord of Aratta writes to Uruk claiming seniority: his city held kingship before Enmerkar's line. The kings trade boasts and riddles until the duel turns to magic: Aratta sends a sorcerer, Uruk an old woman, Sagburru of the Eanna.",
