        id: "1",
        text: "The two came to see the child, and Asita took him in his arms and asked what had been prophesied about him. He predicted that he would leave his home at twenty-nine, that he would be an ascetic for six years, and that then he would find the drink of the cessation of death. Shortly after, feeling his end approaching, he begged Nalada to enter the order of the young Shakya as soon as he should have found the truth, and then he died.",
