        text: "Six hundred years of teeming births later, the land roars with people like a wild ox, and Enlil, troubled by their noise, sends Namtara to destroy them: let pestilence make an end of the clamor. Ea instructs Atrahasis: worship every god but Namtara \u2014 starve the death-god out. Atrahasis gathers the people, and the offerings to Namtara alone bring him bread and water; the god, shamed, accepts the first offering in six centuries and the plague ceases.",
