        id: "1",
        text: "The seven terrors of Humbaba are stripped from him one by one as the friends attack; caught in the net of his own auras, the giant weeps and offers his forest in vassalage, and Gilgamesh's mercy moves. Enkidu insists \u2014 kill him before Shamash's anger changes to aid \u2014 and the guardian's head is struck off and packed for Nippur; the cedar falls, and the friends carry home a victory that the god's rebuke will darken.",
