        text: "Ereshkigal's dance with her fourteen plague-demons puts Nergal to shame in the first descent; he goes down again with the demons of disease as his escort, and the queen of the dead is won by force of presence. The marriage closes the tale: the war god and the death queen rule the land below together, and the disease-demons take their station at the gates \u2014 the underworld's staff named.",
