      en: "Sho-loii, a Bushman vegetable medicine and charm, grows in the mountains near the Orange River; men fight after rubbing their hands with it and heal each other after. An ignorant digger of sho-loii was found speechless among serpents; a skilled application drove the snakes away \u2014 taking the harmful scent with them \u2014 and restored him.",
