        text: "In dreams the answer comes: a young exorcist with a signet draws out the sickness root and branch; a smith restores the body as a smith restores a broken vessel \u2014 the dream-rite of Marduk's mercy. The restoration follows in fact: office, household and health return, and the closing hymn praises the lord of wisdom who turned the sufferer's captivity \u2014 the Babylonian Job ends in praise as it began.",
        note: "Paraphrase of Ludlul, Tablets III-IV (Rogers 1912); not verbatim. / Paraphrase of Ludlul, Tablets III-IV; not verbatim."
