        text: "Sargon, King of Battle, overthrew the city of Uruk in battle, smote the men of Ur, took Lagash and wept over its ruin; he washed his weapons in the Gulf and marched his armies to the Upper Sea. The chronicle's program is the empire's: land from sea to sea under one king, tribute from the lands, and the memory that the first empire was built by a foundling gardener made king by Ishtar.",
