        id: "1",
        text: "In the first year there came out of the Erythraean sea a monster named Oannes: the body of a fish, and beneath the fish's head a man's head, and a man's voice \u2014 the composite image of the wisdom from the deep. He taught men letters, arts, laws and the building of temples, and at sunset he returned to the sea and passed the night in the deep \u2014 civilization's teacher rising daily from the water that had birthed the world.",
