        text: "Hearing Sinta's cries, the ancient eagle Jatayu rises against Rawana's flying chariot and grapples with the ten-faced king in the sky, tearing at his chariot and armor; but Rawana severs his wings with his sword, and the old bird falls dying on the mountain rocks.",
        note: "Paraphrase of the Old Javanese Ramayana kakawin, Jatayu episode (Kats 1919); not verbatim."
