        id: "1",
        text: "In the garden of Asoka trees Sinta, guarded by rakshasa women, refuses Rawana's suit even under the threat of the sword. The rakshasa princess Trijata, Rawana's kin but his conscience, has seen in dream the city burning and the ten-faced king dragged headlong by monkeys.",
