        text: "The infant son of Bima and the giantess Arimbi shows strength beyond mortal measure; in fury and wonder the giant kindred hurl him toward the sky, and he falls back from the clouds to the earth without breaking the ground.",
        note: "Paraphrase of the Javanese Mahabharata tradition (wayang purwa); not verbatim."
