        id: "1",
        text: "Indra sends the apsaras of heaven to the hermitage, Supraba first among them; for a night they dance, play, and pour out every art of attraction at the stone-still ascetic. At dawn the nymphs withdraw defeated, and the gods' counselor marvels: the warrior unmoved by the host of heaven's beauty is ripe to be heaven's own weapon. Arjuna is awarded the mission the temptation was meant to disqualify him from.",
