    summary: {
      en: "The demon-king Niwatakawaca's invulnerability hides a single mortal secret. Supraba, sent as a bride into his palace, learns it from him and passes it to Arjuna; the hidden heart is struck, and the tapa-armoured tyrant falls \u2014 the Javanese epic's doctrine that no citadel of power lacks an inside.",
      zh: "\u9B54\u738B\u5C3C\u74E6\u5854\u5361\u74E6\u67E5\u5200\u69CD\u4E0D\u5165\uFF0C\u552F\u85CF\u4E00\u81F4\u547D\u4E4B\u79D8\u3002\u8607\u666E\u62C9\u5DF4\u4EE5\u65B0\u5A18\u4E4B\u8EAB\u5165\u5176\u5BAE\uFF0C\u63A2\u5F97\u5176\u79D8\u800C\u50B3\u65BC\u963F\u5468\u90A3\uFF1B\u96B1\u85CF\u4E4B\u5FC3\u88AB\u64CA\u4E2D\uFF0C\u4EE5\u82E6\u4FEE\u70BA\u7532\u7684\u66B4\u541B\u96A8\u4E4B\u5012\u4E0B\u2014\u2014\u722A\u54C7\u53F2\u8A69\u4E4B\u6559\u7FA9\uFF1A\u4EFB\u4F55\u6B0A\u529B\u5821\u58D8\u7686\u6709\u5167\u9699\u3002"
    },
    motifs: [
      "cannibal-giant",
      "quest-immortality",
      "wisdom-sacrifice"
    ],
    sensitivity: {
      restricted: false,
      note: "Kakawin paraphrase; intelligence-war motif."
    },
    passages: [
      {
        id: "1",
        text: "Niwatakawaca, the tapa-powered tyrant of the demons, is armoured against every weapon of the gods; his single vulnerability is hidden where no assault can reach \u2014 inside his own palace, in his own confidence. Supraba, sent into the palace as a bride, learns the secret at its source and passes it to Arjuna; the hidden centre is struck and the invulnerable king falls. The epic concludes that power is conquered by knowledge carried in trust, not by force alone.",
        note: "Paraphrase of Kakawin Arjunawiwaha (c. 1030); not verbatim. / Paraphrase of the Kakawin Arjunawiwaha; not verbatim."
      }
    ],
