        id: "1",
        text: "The pellet-shooter came to the large pandi tree, and observing on it what he supposed to be a large black monkey, wished to shoot it; whereupon Prabu Lutung Kasarong, whom he mistook for the monkey, thus addressed him: 'Don't shoot at me; you had better go home and tell your master to come here to me himself.'",
