        text: "Sabai nan Aluih works the rice-fields beside her aged father, Mupo Rajo Nan Saludo of Padang Tarab; the powerful chief Rajo Babanding demands her in marriage, and when the mild old father refuses him, the chief kills him at the field's edge.",
