        id: "1",
        text: "Sent by his king to fetch the remedies that only the sky-kingdom keeps, the youth Cindua Mato climbs the sky-tree into heaven, where he wins the friendship of the sky-princesses and learns the cures of the upper world. The king is saved, but heaven does not release its guests freely: the kaba closes on the price heaven keeps from the hero, and on the standing bargain that Minangkabau's kings may call on the sky \u2014 if the sky may take its due.",
