        text: "Sawerigading, the hero of the line of Batara Guru, desires the twin born with him \u2014 and the desire is impossible: the twin taboo stands across it as the boundary the Bugis world will not move. He builds a great ship and puts out to sea; the ship is fated never to come to rest at the shore of his desire, and his voyaging becomes the epic's image of exile \u2014 the sea as the price of the broken boundary.",
