        id: "1",
        text: "There is also the fast of Nyuapid, which lasts a day and a night, during which time food and sleep must be abstained from; this fast must be held on the first or the fifteenth of the month. The Day of Silence begins the Balinese new year: the island goes dark and still \u2014 no fire, no light, no work, no travel \u2014 so that the demons who sweep over Bali at the year's turning find it empty and pass it by.",
