        text: "The Balinese retellings of the Ramayana keep the whole arc \u2014 the golden deer, the abduction, Hanuman's burning of Alengka, Rawana's fall and Sita's ordeal \u2014 in Balinese idiom, with the island's own names for Rama's party and the rakshasa court.",
