        text: "The Eagle said, 'Go to the fish-weir and pretend to be dead, so that they will carry you into the house. I will go, and you shall take some of the fire. Then run away. We will take it back to our home.' The Beaver went to the fish-weir. They caught him and carried him into the house. They skinned him. Then one man said, 'Look here! There is an eagle. Shoot that eagle.' All the men went out, and the Beaver took the fire and ran away with it. The Beaver jumped into the water and swam back. The Eagle flew above him, and they arrived in their country.",
