    summary: {
      en: "Prince Mani Farendan sails for Malacca with a fleet; at Jambu Ayer a violent storm sinks his ship, and fallen into the sea he leaps upon an albicore \u2014 the alu-alu fish \u2014 by which he is conveyed to land, catching hold of a ganda-suli tree to reach the shore. 'This is the reason that Mani Farendan forbade all his descendants to eat of the fish alu-alu, or to wear the flower of the ganda-suli' \u2014 the house's thanksgiving fixed as a food and flower taboo.",
      zh: "\u746A\u5C3C\xB7\u6CD5\u502B\u4E39\u738B\u5B50\u7387\u8239\u968A\u5F80\u6EFF\u524C\u52A0\uFF1B\u81F3\u5360\u5E03\xB7\u963F\u8036\u723E\uFF0C\u66B4\u98A8\u9A5F\u8D77\u6C89\u5176\u8239\u3002\u4ED6\u589C\u6D77\u4E2D\uFF0C\u8E8D\u4E0A\u9C39\u9B5A\uFF08alu-alu\uFF09\u4E4B\u80CC\uFF0C\u88AB\u8F09\u81F3\u5CB8\u908A\uFF0C\u6500\u4F4F\u683C\u9054-\u8607\u5229\u6A39\u800C\u767B\u9678\u3002\u300E\u6545\u746A\u5C3C\xB7\u6CD5\u502B\u4E39\u7981\u5176\u5B50\u5B6B\u98DF\u9C39\u9B5A\u3001\u4F69\u683C\u9054-\u8607\u5229\u4E4B\u82B1\u300F\u2014\u2014\u5BB6\u65CF\u4E4B\u611F\u6069\u5B9A\u70BA\u98DF\u7981\u8207\u82B1\u7981\u3002"
    },
    motifs: [
      "ritual-origin",
      "taboo-transgression",
      "transformation"
    ],
    sensitivity: {
      restricted: false,
      note: "Fish-rescue etiology fixing a family taboo."
    },
    passages: [
      {
        id: "1",
        text: "When Mani Farendan arrived at Jambu Ayer, the wind arose, and a violent storm succeeded, and the ship of Mani Farendan sunk; and he having fallen into the sea leapt upon an albicore, or alu-alu fish, by which he was conveyed to land.",
        note: "Paraphrase of Malay Annals ch. XI (Leyden 1821); not verbatim."
      },
      {
        id: "2",
        text: "When he reached the shore he caught hold of a ganda-suli tree, and in this manner reached the land. This is the reason that Mani Farendan forbade all his descendants to eat of the fish alu-alu, or to wear the flower of the ganda-suli \u2014 the rescuers of the prince made forever untouchable by his house.",
        note: "Paraphrase of Malay Annals ch. XI (Leyden 1821); not verbatim."
      }
    ],
    persons: []
