        text: "Floods, like other moving things, are conceived to be 'male' and 'female': the belief is that floods due to heavy rain are of one kind and the flood which sometimes rushes down a river-bed another \u2014 the river's two tempers given a gendered taxonomy in the Selangor river-lore collected by Skeat.",
