      archive: "Internet Archive (public-domain full text)",
      work: "Franz Boas and James A. Teit (eds.), Folk-Tales of Salishan and Sahaptin Tribes (1917) \u2014 'Nez Perce Tales, 1. Coyote's Wars' (Mussel-Shell Woman)",
