    license: "Public domain (collection 1917)",
    summary: {
      en: "Several persons suffering from swellings of the body sent for Fox to treat them and make the swelling go away; when these persons were nearly well, Coyote asked Fox for permission to help in the curing \u2014 Fox let Coyote act as shaman, and the patients grew worse again. This happened several times: Fox would make them better, and Coyote would turn round and make them worse. By and by the sick ones ordered Fox to tell Coyote not to help, because he was not a good medicine-man.",
      zh: "\u6751\u4E2D\u591A\u4EBA\u8EAB\u60A3\u816B\u75BE\uFF0C\u8ACB\u72D0\u91AB\u6CBB\u3002\u75C5\u8005\u5C07\u7652\u4E4B\u969B\uFF0C\u90CA\u72FC\u8ACB\u6C42\u5354\u52A9\u65BD\u8853\uFF1B\u72D0\u5141\u4E4B\uFF0C\u75C5\u4EBA\u75C5\u60C5\u5FA9\u60E1\u3002\u5982\u6B64\u6578\u756A\uFF1A\u72D0\u4F7F\u4E4B\u597D\u8F49\uFF0C\u90CA\u72FC\u4E00\u51FA\u624B\u53C8\u4F7F\u4E4B\u60E1\u5316\u3002\u75C5\u8005\u7D42\u65BC\u4E0B\u4EE4\uFF1A\u4E0D\u8A31\u90CA\u72FC\u518D\u63D2\u624B\u2014\u2014\u84CB\u5176\u91AB\u8853\u62D9\u52A3\uFF0C\u4E0D\u8DB3\u70BA\u85A9\u6EFF\u3002"
    },
    motifs: [
      "witch",
      "parable-teaching",
      "ritual-origin",
      "shaman-journey"
    ],
    sensitivity: {
      restricted: false,
      note: "Condensed paraphrase of a Nez Perce narrative collected by Spinden (Boas & Teit, 1917); not verbatim. Spinden notes the story illustrates the custom of dismissing medicine-men who could not effect cures. Published folk-narrative only. Category 'myth'."
    },
    passages: [
      {
        id: "1",
        text: "Now, there were several persons suffering from swellings of the body, and they sent for Fox to treat them and make the swelling go away. When these persons were nearly well, Coyote asked Fox for permission to help in the curing. So Fox let Coyote act as shaman, and the patients grew worse again. This happened several times: Fox would make them better, and Coyote would turn round and make them worse. By and by the sick ones ordered Fox to tell Coyote not to help, because he was not a good medicine-man.",
        note: "Paraphrase of Folk-Tales of Salishan and Sahaptin Tribes, p. 186 (Spinden, 1917); not verbatim."
      }
    ]
