        text: "He went along; he saw Deer. He thought he would kill him; the wind was blowing and frightened him. He did thus to it; he went on. He stood there holding (in the hand) his head thus. Coyote said: 'Is that your father's war bonnet?' The thing said: 'What is it? Do you forget that you killed me?' Coyote said: 'I thought it was nothing.' Enough.",
