        text: "And I will establish My covenant between Me and thee and thy seed after thee throughout their generations for an everlasting covenant, to be a God unto thee and to thy seed after thee. ... This is My covenant, which ye shall keep, between Me and you and thy seed after thee: every male among you shall be circumcised.",
