        text: "And to Thamud We sent their brother Salih. He said, 'O my people, worship God: ye have no other god than Him. Now hath a clear sign come to you from your Lord \u2014 this she-camel of God is a sign to you. Let her alone to feed on God's earth, and touch her with no harm, lest a grievous chastisement seize you.'",
