        id: "1",
        text: "And when thy Lord drew forth from the children of Adam, out of their loins, their posterity, and made them bear witness against themselves \u2014 'Am I not your Lord?' \u2014 they said, 'Yes, we do bear witness.' Lest ye should say on the day of resurrection, 'Verily we were heedless of this'; or lest ye should say, 'Our fathers, indeed, formerly joined gods with God, and we were their posterity after them: wilt thou then destroy us for the doings of the vain ones?'",
