        text: "And Moses was an hundred and twenty years old when he died; his eye was not dimmed, nor his natural force abated. And the children of Israel wept for Moses in the plains of Moab thirty days... And there arose not a prophet since in Israel like unto Moses, whom the LORD knew face to face.",
