        text: "And We appointed thirty nights for Moses, and completed them with ten; and the term of his Lord was fulfilled, forty nights. And Moses said to Aaron his brother, 'Take my place among my people, and act rightly, and follow not the way of the mischief-makers.' And when Moses came at Our appointed time, and his Lord spoke with him, he said, 'O my Lord, show me thyself, that I may look upon thee.' He said, 'Thou shalt not see me: but look upon the mountain; if it stand firm in its place, then shalt thou see me.'",
