        id: "1",
        text: "The Messenger of God passed by a woman who was among the punished of the Hereafter, holding a cat she had tethered. She had neither fed it nor given it water to drink, nor had she freed it to eat the creeping things of the earth, until it died of hunger. He was asked whether it was one of the jinn, and he said that it was one of the jinn? He said, 'It was not a jinni: it was a woman among the punished, punished for a cat she had kept captive \u2014 she neither fed it nor gave it drink, nor freed it to eat the creatures of the earth, till it died.'",
