        text: "The Prophet said: Seven are the people whom God will shade with His shade on the day when there is no shade but His shade: a just ruler; a young man who has been brought up in the worship of God; a man whose heart is attached to the mosques when he leaves them until he returns to them; two men who love one another for God's sake, who come together upon that love and part upon it; a man who is called by a woman of rank and beauty for sin, and he says, 'I fear God'; a man who gives in charity and hides it, so much so that his left hand does not know what his right hand has given; and a man who remembers God in solitude and his eyes overflow.",
