        id: "1",
        text: "The Messenger of God said: The truthful, trustworthy merchant will be with the prophets, the truthful and the martyrs. And the buyer and the seller have the option of the transaction as long as they have not separated; if both of them speak the truth and make it plain, their transaction will be blessed; but if they speak falsehood and conceal anything, then the blessing of their transaction will be erased.",
