        id: "1",
        text: "The Prophet said: Whoever believes in God and the Last Day should not hurt his neighbour; and he said: Treat women kindly, for woman has been created from a rib, and the most crooked part of the rib is the upper part; if you try to straighten it you will break it, and if you leave it as it is, it will remain crooked; so treat women kindly.",
