        id: "1",
        text: "Aisha said: I raced with the Prophet and beat him in the race. Later, when I had put on weight, I raced with him again, and he beat me. He said: 'This is for that previous race of yours.' The Prophet races with Aisha and she beats him; later, when she has put on weight, she races him again and he wins.",
