        id: "1",
        text: "And the LORD turned the captivity of Job, when he prayed for his friends; and the LORD gave Job twice as much as he had before. ... And in all the land were no women found so fair as the daughters of Job; and their father gave them inheritance among their brethren. So Job died, being old and full of days.",
