      en: "Yeh Ch'\xFCeh presses Wang Ni to affirm an absolute standard of good; Wang Ni answers with the eel that likes wet, the monkey that likes trees, and the beauties at whom fish and birds flee. The Perfect Man, though, is a spiritual being: scorched ocean and frozen Milky Way cannot touch him; he mounts the clouds, driving the sun and moon before him, beyond death and life.",
