        text: "He entered and saluted; the caliph reproached him, and then spoke the word the historians have kept: 'Art thou Abu Muslim? I will make thee a prey to the dogs of the streets.' The bodyguard closed; and the maker of the dynasty was slain in the caliph's tent. Persia murmured for twenty years after, and the sects that remembered him raised him to a hidden lord.",
