        id: "1",
        text: `Yeh Ch'\xFCeh meeting Hs\xFC Yu, said to him, "Where are you going?" "Away from Yao!" replied the latter. "What do you mean?" asked Yeh Ch'\xFCeh. "Yao," said Hs\xFC Yu, "thinks of nothing but charity. I fear he will become a laughing-stock to the world, and that in future ages men will eat one another.`
