        text: `Finally, they brought him in front of a mound and said: "This is the tomb where your ancestors lie buried." The old man could control himself no longer, and wept aloud. But his fellow-travellers burst into roars of laughter. "We have been hoaxing you," they cried; "this is only the Chin State." Their victim was greatly mortified; and when they arrived at their journey's end, and he really did see before him the city and altars of Yen, with the actual abode and tombs of his ancestors, his emotion was much less acute.`
