      work: "Charles L. Edwards, 'Bahama Songs and Stories' (1895), story XII 'B' Rabby an' B' Tar-Baby'",
      url: "https://archive.org/download/bahamasongsands00edwagoog/bahamasongsands00edwagoog_djvu.txt"
