        text: "The troops and National Guard were summoned, for even the word rescue had been pronounced; the prisoners, tied in pairs, were placed in a line and faced by five soldiers to each pair. As usual the prisoners behaved with great courage, even the women standing up unflinchingly before their executioners.",
